      "questionTextEn": "The `ORDER_DATE` column in the `ORDERS` table is of type `DATE` and stores time components as well (for example, an order placed at `15-MAY-2026 14:30:00`). What happens to that `15-MAY-2026 14:30:00` order when you execute the following query?",
