      "questionTextEn": "**You want to join 3 tables — `EMPLOYEES (e)`, `DEPARTMENTS (d)`, and `LOCATIONS (l)` — to display **all employees** (including those without a department), along with their department name and city if available. Which query is CORRECT?**",
