      "questionTextEn": "Suppose the subquery `(SELECT salary FROM employees WHERE job_id = 'IT_PROG')` returns three values: `4000`, `6000`, and `9000`. Which condition is equivalent to `WHERE salary > ANY (SELECT salary FROM employees WHERE job_id = 'IT_PROG')`?",
