      "questionTextEn": "Using the same `T1` (`(10, 'A')`, `(20, NULL)`, `(NULL, NULL)`) and `T2` (`(20, NULL)`, `(NULL, NULL)`) tables from Question 4, what is returned by the following `MINUS` query?",
