      "questionTextEn": "You create a sequence named `EMP_SEQ` with `START WITH 1 INCREMENT BY 1`. The `DEPARTMENTS` table currently contains `3` rows. You execute the unconditional `INSERT ALL` statement below into two empty tables `TAB1(id)` and `TAB2(id)`. Which values will be stored in `TAB1` and `TAB2`?",
