      "questionTextEn": "What is the difference between the default window frame of `SUM(salary) OVER (PARTITION BY department_id)` (without `ORDER BY`) and `SUM(salary) OVER (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY employee_id)` (with `ORDER BY`)?",
