      "questionTextEn": "**In the `EMP_TEST` table, department `10` has 3 employees with `FIRST_NAME` and `BONUS_CODE` as follows:**\n- **Alice: `'GOLD'`**\n- **Bob: `NULL`**\n- **Charlie: `'SILVER'`**\n\n**When you evaluate `LISTAGG(bonus_code, '-') WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY first_name ASC)` for department `10`, what string is returned?**",
