      "questionTextEn": "When you write `LISTAGG(first_name, ', ' ON OVERFLOW TRUNCATE) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY first_name)` without specifying a custom truncation indicator string or `WITH/WITHOUT COUNT`, what default suffix does Oracle append to a truncated string?",
