      "questionTextEn": "Examine the `PIVOT` query below against the `EMPLOYEES` table (which contains columns `EMPLOYEE_ID`, `FIRST_NAME`, `HIRE_DATE`, `DEPARTMENT_ID`, `JOB_ID`, `SALARY`). Why does this query fail to group the output into one summary row per `DEPARTMENT_ID`, returning hundreds of separate rows instead?",
