      "questionTextEn": "Consider the hierarchy chain: `King (100)` manages `De Haan (102)`; `De Haan (102)` manages `Hunold (103)`; `Hunold (103)` manages `Ernst (104)`. When you execute the query below (where `employee_id != 102` is in the `WHERE` clause), which employees from this chain appear in the output?",
