      "codeSnippet": "SELECT emp_id, first_name, LEVEL, CONNECT_BY_ISLEAF AS is_leaf\nFROM org_emp\nSTART WITH emp_id = 102 -- De Haan (LEVEL 1)\nCONNECT BY PRIOR emp_id = mgr_id\n       AND LEVEL <= 2;  -- Dừng ở Hunold (LEVEL 2)",
