      "questionTextEn": "`DEPARTMENTS (department_id PK)` is the parent table and `EMPLOYEES (department_id FK)` is the child table. The foreign key column `EMPLOYEES.department_id` is NOT indexed. What happens when a session executes `DELETE FROM departments WHERE department_id = 90;` (before committing)?",
