      "codeSnippet": "-- Dòng 1:\nINSERT INTO logs(log_id, message) VALUES (1, 'Start job');\n-- Dòng 2:\nSET TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL SERIALIZABLE;\n-- Dòng 3:\nUPDATE accounts SET balance = balance + 100 WHERE account_id = 10;\n-- Dòng 4:\nCOMMIT;",
