      "questionTextEn": "While `Session 1` is in the middle of an uncommitted transaction (`UPDATE employees SET salary = 8000 WHERE employee_id = 105;`), `Session 2` attempts to execute the DDL statement: `ALTER TABLE employees DROP COLUMN commission_pct;`. What happens to `Session 2`'s statement?",
