          "text": "`Session 2` **waits (is blocked on a `TX` lock in mode 4)** at `T2` until `Session 1` finishes: if `Session 1` executes `COMMIT`, `Session 2` then raises `ORA-00001`; if `Session 1` executes `ROLLBACK`, `Session 2`'s `INSERT` proceeds and succeeds!"
