      "questionTextEn": "On a 100-million-row `TRANSACTIONS` table (indexed on `(created_at DESC, trans_id DESC)`), why is `Keyset (Seek) Pagination` thousands of times faster than `Offset Pagination` (`OFFSET 5000000 ROWS FETCH NEXT 20 ROWS ONLY`) when fetching deep pages?",
