          "key": "C",
          "text": "Only a Weak `REF CURSOR` (such as `SYS_REFCURSOR`) can be opened with a dynamic SQL query string (`OPEN rc FOR v_sql_string`), whereas a Strong `REF CURSOR` cannot be used with dynamic SQL."
