      "questionTextEn": "Examine the `trg_check_sal` trigger on the `EMPLOYEES` table below. What happens when a user executes `UPDATE employees SET salary = salary * 1.1 WHERE department_id = 30;` (assuming department 30 has 6 employees)?",
