      "questionTextEn": "If `trg_check_sal` is defined as `AFTER INSERT OR UPDATE ON employees FOR EACH ROW` and queries `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM employees;`, which DML statement on `EMPLOYEES` will NOT raise `ORA-04091: table is mutating`?",
