      "questionTextEn": "After executing `FORALL i IN 1 .. v_depts.COUNT UPDATE employees SET salary = salary + 100 WHERE department_id = v_depts(i);`, which attribute tells you how many rows were updated specifically by the 3rd element (`v_depts(3)`)?",
