      "questionTextEn": "In Oracle 11g and later, if a complex dynamic SQL query has been parsed, bound, and executed using `DBMS_SQL` (with cursor ID `v_cur_id INTEGER := DBMS_SQL.OPEN_CURSOR;`), which function converts `v_cur_id` into a `SYS_REFCURSOR` variable so it can be returned to a client application?",
